    <!-- Tooltips (Action - Context - Shortcut) -->
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnStartServer">Start the MCP gateway: opens the local named pipe so AI clients (through RevitAgent.Shim) can call tools.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnStopServer">Stop the MCP gateway: closes the connected AI sessions.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnLaunchRevit">Open a NEW Revit (revit_launch) for the year selected in the "Revit versions &amp; Bridge" card. Never touches the Revit you already have running.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnCaptureScreenshot">Capture the main window of the Revit selected in the list, show it in the right column and save it to the captures folder.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnSandboxFolder">Open the runs folder: where the gateway keeps model copies and the results of every scenario run.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnClearLogs">Clear Display Logs: Clears in-memory timeline log entries from the display view (disk logs remain intact).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnThemeToggle">Toggle Theme: Switches color palette between Match Windows OS, Dark Mode, and Light Mode.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnLangVi">Switch to Vietnamese: changes the whole interface language to Vietnamese.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BtnLangEn">Switch to English: Switch entire user interface to English.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BadgeDesktop">Desktop Interactive State: Checks whether Windows session is unlocked and active to receive input.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BadgeIpc">MCP gateway state: the local named pipe is listening for AI clients.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BadgeBridge">Bridge state: at least one Revit has connected its Bridge to the gateway.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_Tooltip_BadgeUac">UAC Elevation Parity Check: Verifies Host and Revit share matching integrity levels (Medium or Elevated) to avoid UIPI message blocking.</sys:String>
